# Legacy single-engine eagle-eye: RETIRED 2026-10-14, replaced by 3 engines.

# Degen watchlist v1: RETIRED 2026-10-14 with Degen v1.
# Degen peak tracker: NOT retired — REVIVED 2026-10-23 (see stanza above;
# the nightly learner labels winners from its peaks).
# Degen fastwatch v1: RETIRED 2026-10-14 with Degen v1.
